          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4cqw;background:#222b48;border:1px solid #e4ca8e;border-radius:16px;color:#f5efff;font-family:system-ui'><div style='font:800 2cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#e8cf91'>GLOSSARY / A FIELD GUIDE</div><h2 style='font:600 6.4cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:2cqw 0'>One graph. Several ways of seeing it.</h2><p style='font:400 2.9cqw/1.45 system-ui;color:#cfd6e8;margin:0'>Begin with Reading, move into Making, and visit Building when you want to define the model itself. The complete definitions are on the Glossary page below.</p></div>"
