        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "\n<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%,#554474,#181d37 52%,#10172d);color:#f4efff;font-family:system-ui'>\n<div style='position:absolute;inset:2.3cqw;border:1px solid #8d7aa8;border-radius:2cqw;pointer-events:none'></div>\n<div style='position:absolute;top:4cqw;left:6cqw;font:800 1.7cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.20em;color:#e8cf91'>THE TWILITE ZONE · THE LIBRARY</div>\n<h1 style='position:absolute;top:7cqw;left:6cqw;margin:0;font:600 10cqw/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.045em'>The Glossary</h1>\n<div style='position:absolute;left:6cqw;top:20cqw;font:400 2.5cqw/1.4 system-ui;color:#c9d1e5'>An atlas of the language behind every graph.</div>\n<div style='position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5cqw;top:29cqw;bottom:15cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.5cqw'>\n<div style='border-top:.8cqw solid #b8d8ff;padding:3cqw 2.8cqw;background:#212946a8'><div style='font:800 1.6cqw system-ui;color:#b8d8ff;letter-spacing:.15em'>01 / READING</div><div style='font:600 4cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin-top:3cqw'>Understand what you see.</div><div style='margin-top:5cqw;width:80%;height:1px;background:#b8d8ff;opacity:.65'></div></div><div style='border-top:.8cqw solid #e8ce90;padding:3cqw 2.8cqw;background:#212946a8'><div style='font:800 1.6cqw system-ui;color:#e8ce90;letter-spacing:.15em'>02 / MAKING</div><div style='font:600 4cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin-top:3cqw'>Give ideas a durable shape.</div><div style='margin-top:5cqw;width:80%;height:1px;background:#e8ce90;opacity:.65'></div></div><div style='border-top:.8cqw solid #c9b8ff;padding:3cqw 2.8cqw;background:#212946a8'><div style='font:800 1.6cqw system-ui;color:#c9b8ff;letter-spacing:.15em'>03 / BUILDING</div><div style='font:600 4cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin-top:3cqw'>Define behavior and reuse.</div><div style='margin-top:5cqw;width:80%;height:1px;background:#c9b8ff;opacity:.65'></div></div>\n</div><div style='position:absolute;bottom:4cqw;left:6cqw;font:700 2cqw system-ui;color:#e8cf91'>WORDS → STRUCTURE → EXPERIENCE</div>\n</div>"
        },
